{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_kjera_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_kjera_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"祂所關心的","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kjera_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"47fbef608ffdddf82f539501c858f305d4e475bd7bbc990850357bb5797a6c55","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你去過剛翻新的印刷廠了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有欸，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天我跟著去看了一眼，比我想的還要厲害好多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設備都是全新的，地方也很寬敞，跟以前那個破爛地方完全不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看，這是印刷廠的主管給我的樣品，這是現在的印刷品質。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個紙質……還有這個字體的精細度……這也太好了吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧？一想到以後我們編寫的東西都會在那裡變成書籍，我就好激動啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的啊？那太好了，以前的印刷廠設備太老了，都要沒法用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不是嘛，主管也很高興，說不管我們有多少想印的東西他都吃得下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_282_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，那我們也不能落後了，得寫出配得上這種印刷品質的文字才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了！抱歉，今天早上廚房有點缺人手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒，你來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你說你，當侍女長就夠忙了，我們這邊不那麼放在心上也沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行。這畢竟是我主動向聖女大人討來的工作，要是不做好我心裡可過意不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，聖女大人對這本《謝拉格旅遊手冊》也是在意得很，畢竟這關乎我們謝拉格的對外形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們剛剛還在說呢，感覺啊，謝拉格現在真是每天都在變好，我們也不能落後了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g4_boudoir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天又要開三族議會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法，畢竟維多利亞的態度是個大麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，恩希歐迪斯種下的禍根，果然還是發芽了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，也只能走一步看一步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，雅兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一件事想要跟你商量商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":"avg_174_slbell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想和祂做一個約定——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒，雅兒，你怎麼忽然發起呆了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，沒什麼。這麼說起來，平常最討厭“落後”這個詞的，我們親愛的旅遊部部長大人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦，卡哈很少遲到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面色焦急的婦人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是旅遊部嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活潑的職員","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你不是卡哈的夫人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，太好了，我沒找錯地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，你的臉色不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我有急事，可以讓我見聖女大人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不是常跟在聖女大人身邊的雅兒侍女長嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，這事和我家另一半有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他一直反對兒子去留學，但我兒也非常固執，他偷偷摸摸自己存了學費要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……唉，我也是心軟，最後他讓我瞞著卡哈，我就同意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道卡哈還是發現了，他現在去車站抓兒子去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的脾氣頑固得很，但我兒也不比他差，這要是真鬧起來，我、我實在不知道怎麼辦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒侍女長，您能不能請聖女大人幫幫忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人今天不在山上，現在去請她怕也是為時已晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都怪我，要是我能攔住卡哈就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我跟你去一趟吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的職責之一，本來就是替聖女大人分憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事，我還是可以代表聖女大人說上幾句的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對，鄉親們都知道雅兒侍女長你是聖女大人的心腹，你說的話一定管用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們快走吧，卡哈這時候應該已經到車站了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這車站裡人這麼多，要上哪裡去找卡哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你說過許多次了，只要我還活著一天，你就別想著去留學！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我們不用找了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，人都圍起來了，他也不怕被鄰居笑話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也說了很多次，這學，我是留定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是真的不明白，你到底是從哪裡學的這一套所謂先進的玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不知道，你整天只想著你的信仰，喔不，應該說，靠所謂的信仰讓自己獲得更多的權力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我閉嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不告訴自己的父親，偷偷跑來車站，現在還在這裡說這些，還嫌自己不夠丟臉嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什麼丟臉的，丟臉的是你吧，旅遊部部長卡哈閣下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這渾小子——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，雅兒侍女長，你快想想辦法吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，真虧恩雅每天都要解決這種無聊的事情，好想回去，好想給剛才信誓旦旦地說要替聖女大人分憂的自己一巴掌。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要不然隨便說兩句。剩下的還是留給恩雅解決吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒侍女長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你從爺爺那裡拿不到自己想要的東西，就想把我變成你想要的樣子是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再說一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道爺爺現在在哪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從來不理解爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不理解他？是他不理解我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，隨你怎麼說吧。我雖然做不到像爺爺那樣把一輩子都交給群山之間的雜草和碎石，但是，我喜歡爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去學那些先進的東西，回來好幫他老人家更好更快地為耶拉岡德磨爪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不像你，只想把爺爺和祖先們留下的東西，當成自己往上爬的台階！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長卡哈","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，請問卡哈的父親是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他爸？是個一年到頭都在山上敲敲打打，家也不回幾次的怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嫁給卡哈時，他們父子關係就已經很糟糕了，我想和公公搞好關係，但一直找不到機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一次聽卡哈喝醉後說，公公好像一直認為自己在幫耶拉岡德修指甲，所以一直把自己留在山上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那他呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……他說他這輩子也不會跟他爸爸做一樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說他爸太傻，那根本不是信仰什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"部長夫人","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒侍女長，你要去哪裡，你不是說你會出面幫忙嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有更好的人選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）……也許吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g9_manoravenue"},{"type":"narration","text":"大部分謝拉格人在成長的過程中，都會通過各種方式了解到圍繞著謝拉格這塊土地的那些山峰的名字。\n他們會出於一些原因踏入其中一些山峰，但這些山峰往往也是比較有名的那些。\n那些默默無聞的山峰，就算是謝拉格當地人，也鮮少踏足。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"而雅兒此時踏上的這座山，正是眾多默默無聞的山峰中的一座，這座山峰甚至並沒有被命名，更不像是有人會踏足的樣子。\n此時，如果有其他人也走在這條山路上，恐怕會感到一絲驚奇。\n原因很簡單，除了被喀蘭貿易開發成景點的山峰，沒有哪座山峰的山道能像這座山的一樣平整。\n——不，恐怕就算是已經成為景點的山峰，山道也很難比這裡的要乾淨。\n是的，乾淨。\n樹木被修剪過，草叢也似乎被規定了生長的區域，沒有亂石。\n簡直就像一座園林。\n行至半山處，叮叮噹噹的清脆聲響就從高處傳來，那聲音時快時慢，在山谷之間迴盪，彷彿有個巨人正在群山之間錘打他的武器。\n雅兒記得這個聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"narration","text":"踏上山頂的時候，聲音的主人也現出真容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那並非巨人，他所敲打的也絕非武器。\n那裡只有一個身形傴僂的老人，正拿著錘與鑿對著一塊突出的石頭敲打。\n與石頭相比，無論是老人，或是老人手中的錘與鑿，都顯得有些渺小，但老人似乎毫不在意，只是進行著自己的敲打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知為何，雅兒似乎鬆了口氣。\n然後，她拿起放在一旁的多餘工具，走到老人身邊，跟他一起開始對著這塊巨石敲打。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人沒有問，雅兒沒有說。\n沉默並沒有帶來尷尬，反而催生了某種難言的默契。\n一鑿，一錘。一鑿，一錘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人依然沒有說話，只是走到旁邊，從背包裡拿起水喝了一口。\n然後，他掏出了兩塊用油紙包好的雜糧餅，並把其中一塊遞向雅兒。\n雅兒並沒有客氣，接過雜糧餅，坐到老人身邊就吃了起來。\n老人則打開另一塊雜糧餅的油紙，開始大口大口地吃了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在這裡做什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道，來幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為看起來很有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們家世世代代都只做一件事，就是為耶拉岡德修剪爪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爪子……？您是說指甲？"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人抬起頭，指了指遠處那片最為高聳且連綿的山峰，然後又指了指那些山峰旁邊較為矮小的那片山峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連綿的群山是祂的脊背，脊背之外凸起的那些矮小的峰巒，就是祂的“爪”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，耶拉岡德不是一位女性嗎？湖心島正在建造她的雕像呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是祂為了與子民們相處而幻化出的人形，那確實是耶拉岡德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這片群山也是耶拉岡德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的祖先曾經親眼見過，祂在漫天的黑雨中，發動神力，豎起盾牌保護謝拉格人民的光景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，祂得勝了，但也付出了重傷的代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖先感恩於祂的庇護，主動為祂清理爪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，這就成了你們家族的傳承。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的這些傳承要是傳出去，恐怕整個蔓珠院都要急著來找您吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你是替我兒子來的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去告訴他，那些祖先留下的東西，我不會給他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是您兒子的使者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是覺得有些可惜，您的兒子和您的孫子看來都不打算接過您的衣缽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我這輩子，只知道在山上敲敲打打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本以為卡哈也會跟著我一起，就像我跟著我爹一樣，但是，回過神來，他就成了現在的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嘴笨，也不知道該怎麼辦，乾脆躲到了山上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒記錯的話，卡哈今年快四十了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的孩童時期，恰好趕上希瓦艾什家的前任家主奧拉維爾從維多利亞留學回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，您應該也記得，這些鐵路啊什麼的，就是那時候開始造的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您可能不知道，奧拉維爾帶回來的不只是技術，還有思想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在當時，整個謝拉格都因為他的開放思想而陷入了爭執，而其中，最容易受影響的，無疑是年輕人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，卡哈也一定深受影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他的家族卻世代要為耶拉岡德修爪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在當時，恐怕也挺為難的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道他中間究竟想了什麼，又做了什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這樣去想，似乎能理解，為什麼他會變成現在這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不怪您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您從您的父親那裡接過了鑿與錘，而您的父親又從您父親的父親那裡接過，一直到您那位祖先——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都只是在全心全意地做著自己手上的事，你們又做錯了什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的孫子說，他打算去學一些新的東西，好讓您更好地為耶拉岡德磨爪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那哈這小子，常常來看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他給我搞的那些東西，什麼通訊終端之類的機器，我統統用不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您真的討厭這些新的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我看著鐵路一點一點從東邊鋪到了西邊，又看著高樓一點一點起得比山還要高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是耶拉岡德真的不喜歡這些，祂翻個身就能把這些都抖下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……相信耶拉岡德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就繼續相信耶拉岡德吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一點，我可以向您保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是有一天，耶拉岡德真的從群山之中翻身而起，到那個時候，您修剪的指甲，一定是祂身上最為閃耀的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"看著雅兒離去的背影，老人突然覺得有些熟悉。\n他仔細思索，一會兒，終於意識到，這個身姿與祖先留下的傳承中的那個身影有些相似。\n那個身影，走過災難降臨後的土地，走過絕望與悲鳴，走過冰雪消融的枝丫，走過暖陽，為謝拉格帶來了希望。\n老人渾濁的雙眼閃過一絲恍然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"耶拉岡德在上，耶拉岡德在上。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他從懷中掏出孫子送給他的通訊終端。\n雖然他用不習慣，但為了讓孫子高興，他還是努力學了。\n終端上保存了兩個號碼，一個是家裡的，一個是孫子的，他撥通了後者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那哈，對，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡哈在你身邊是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去告訴他，他想要的東西，我會給他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他要放你走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，然後，把終端給他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修甲人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有話跟他說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知為何，走了幾步，雅兒就停了下來。\n她抬頭看向遠處的群山，不知何時，奇異的石塊漂浮在了她的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，你啊你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若是放在過去，你又怎麼會說這些話呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡哈的信仰虔誠卻盲目，那哈的衝勁蓬勃卻莽撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達哈這樣的人，曾是你欣賞的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少個夜晚，你躺在群山之間，在那敲敲打打的聲音中酣然入睡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊你，你不知感恩，還將達哈數落一通，這下好了，誰還會喜歡你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雅兒捧起石頭，她的語氣像是對著石頭另一邊的人抱怨，卻又像是在照一面鏡子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"石頭微微震動，然後發出聲響。\n那是她的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，你啊你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道還不想承認，認識了那個女孩之後，你發生了多大的改變？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"你有了朋友，有了歸處，有了想要的東西，自然而然地，也就有了立場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是你過去最討厭的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直希望謝拉格人能夠按照他們自己的想法生活下去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是只是想要守望他們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊你，希瓦艾什這一家子啊，害苦了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"說著什麼希望，談著什麼未來，把你框得好慘！"},{"type":"narration","text":"高原的寒風刮過山巒，而後拂過她的耳畔，在她聽來，那是祂的笑聲。\n一點促狹，一點調侃，一點自嘲，一點無奈。\n祂在笑誰？當然是祂自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說朋友，你也不是沒有在過去交過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說聯繫，你也從未真正置身事外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想幫忙，卻說我不該出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得不對，卻想他們應該有自己的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊你，你當真不明白為什麼你會選了她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她特殊到在前後千百年都獨一無二？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是，其實只是她替你做了你想做的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懸浮石","speakerId":"avg_npc_251","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雅兒，你在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在……說了你也不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。我聽說，你替我出面解決了一點小麻煩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，聖女大人消息真是靈通呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不想知道，但他們又非得讓我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖女大人想說什麼就說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前的問題，你想得怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼問題，今晚的晚餐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我沒在跟你開玩笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是約定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞馬上就要派人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到那時，無論發生什麼，我都希望祂不要出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不到祂出手的時候，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是連這個危機都無法靠自己渡過，那麼，我就去跳銀心湖算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，你啊，有的時候真是比你哥哥還要倔強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就當你在誇我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你今晚回蔓珠院嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上就回去，還要做飯給聖女大人，我哪敢懈怠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼感覺，你的心情還蠻好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這你都覺得得出來啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那當然了，我們都認識多久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，只是今天天氣不錯，稍微散了個步而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，晚上見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雅兒","speakerId":"avg_npc_250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，哎呀呀，我啊我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"清脆的笑聲乘著風，拂過群山之巔，這一次，是她的笑聲。\n她不再停留，向聖山的方向走去。\n該回去了，她還有工作呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
